  "sourceTitle": "Peach Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Peach Salsa\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 4:48pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 mediums peaches, diced\n1/2 English cucumber, diced\n1/4 cup finely-diced onion\n1/4 cup chopped cilantro\n1 jalipeno pepper, finely diced (approx. 2 tbs)\n2 tablespoons lime juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place all ingredients in a medium bowl and toss to combine. Serve immediately and refrigerate up to 2 hours.\n\nAbout\n\n\nSweet and spicy, this peach salsa is perfect to jazz up your chips routine, especially in the summer when peaches are in season.",
